This benchmark tests a **two-hop dependency chain**:
1. **Craft wooden_shovel** — requires knowledge of the recipe (1 plank + 2 sticks in vertical column) and use of the 3×3 crafting table grid
2. **Mine podzol** — requires equipping the crafted shovel and breaking a podzol block from the clearly-visible patch

